    "name": "The Trolley Solution",
    "steam_appid": 3219410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/baff3c229f9c6b156950522be6dab89d.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophers already waste their time and lives thinking about thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not have fun while doing it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trolley Solution</strong> is a compilation of minigames based on the famous trolley problem, originally proposed in 1967 by British philosopher Philippa Foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your thinking power to the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/baff3c229f9c6b156950522be6dab89d.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophers already waste their time and lives thinking about thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not have fun while doing it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trolley Solution</strong> is a compilation of minigames based on the famous trolley problem, originally proposed in 1967 by British philosopher Philippa Foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your thinking power to the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.poster.avif?t=1752262083\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.webm?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.mp4?t=1752262083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>",
